ving my flush draw a chance to hit (~20%) while minimizing risk if my opponent has trips or better. If a club hits, I can value bet; if not, I can reassess based on opponent's river action. Given the passive play so far, checking maintains pot control while preserving my tournament life.\n\nAnswer: 0"}
